al., 2002, pp. 26, 30 and 33, Eqs. 38-41); the cross-check with Allen,
Tasumi and Trezza (2007) is desirable but no longer blocking
(\code{dev/VERIFICATION.md}). \code{tol}, \code{maxit}, \code{damping}, \code{pixel_tol} and
